  "hints": [
    "An odd integer is 2 times some integer, plus 1.",
    "Expand (2a + 1)³ and group everything except the final 1 into a multiple of 2."
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Since $x$ is odd, $x = 2a + 1$ for some integer $a$.",
    "$x^3 = (2a+1)^3 = 8a^3 + 12a^2 + 6a + 1 = 2(4a^3 + 6a^2 + 3a) + 1$.",
    "$4a^3 + 6a^2 + 3a$ is an integer, so $x^3$ is odd. $\\blacksquare$"
  ],
